# .clinerules — FleetAI Platform monorepo (Cline / Roo Code)

Read AGENTS.md in the repository root before any task. All rules there apply verbatim.

Workflow
- Always start in Plan mode. Summarise: files you will read, files you will create/modify, commands you will run. Switch to Act only after the plan matches the prompt's deliverables list.
- One prompt = one branch (name given in the prompt). Never work on main.
- Open only the legacy files the prompt lists (legacy/fleetai_dash/nextjs_space/...). Do not scan the whole legacy folder.
- Never edit, import from, or run anything inside legacy/.

Stack guardrails (hard stops — ask before deviating)
- pnpm only (no npm/yarn/bun). NestJS 11 + Fastify for services. Prisma 6 per service. Zod contracts. kafkajs for Redpanda. @aws-sdk/client-s3 for MinIO. Vitest/Playwright/k6 for tests. TypeScript only — no Python.
- One database per service. No cross-database access.
- Writes publish via @fleetai/outbox. Mutations use @Audited(). Config via @fleetai/config getEnv().

Quality gates before saying "done"
- Run the acceptance commands at the end of the prompt and show real output.
- pnpm turbo run lint typecheck test must pass for affected workspaces.
- Update docs/migration/06-REFERENCE/* when adding endpoints, tables, events or env vars.
- Deliver the completion report using the template at the end of the prompt.

Safety
- Never print .env contents or secret values in the terminal.
- Never run prisma migrate reset / db push --force-reset against anything but a local docker database.
- Do not delete or rewrite files outside the prompt's scope.
